OL,3,AHyrox athlete apologises for continuing
OL,4,Arace after soiling herself
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Australian athlete who faced
OL,7,Fcriticism for continuing to compete in
OL,8,Fa Hyrox event after soiling herself has
OL,9,Fapologised and said she will
OL,10,Fretroactively withdraw from the race.
OL,12,FJoanna Wietrzyk offered her "sincere
OL,13,Fapology" for the incident during the
OL,14,Findoor fitness competition in Beijing
OL,15,Fon Saturday, saying she should have
OL,16,F"made a different choice" and exited
OL,17,Fthe event.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
